# Title: Disable Windows IIS HTTP Logging
# ID: e4ed6030-ffe5-4e6a-8a8a-ab3c1ab9d94e
# Status: test
# Level: high
# Author: frack113
# Date: 2022-01-09
# Tags: attack.defense-impairment, attack.t1685.001
# Description: Disables HTTP logging on a Windows IIS web server as seen by Threat Group 3390 (Bronze Union)
# Converted by: Sigma Universal SIEM/EDR CLI

index=* eventtype=wineventlog (((process_exec="*set*" AND process_exec="*config*" AND process_exec="*section:httplogging*" AND process_exec="*dontLog:true*")) AND ((process_path="*\\appcmd.exe") OR (process_name="appcmd.exe")))
